You unleash the fury of the Spellblaze, constantly draining your vim.

While this spell is active at most two meteors will fall near your per turn, dealing [64, 87, 104, 119, 132 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical and [64, 87, 104, 119, 132 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage in radius 2.

This spell disabled automatically on rest or run.

The effects increase with spellpower.
